---
import RoundedGrid from "../assets/RoundedGrid.astro";
---
<section class="relative overflow-x-hidden">
  <svg
    class="absolute top-0 right-0 blur-3xl opacity-80"
    width="50%"
    height="100%"
    viewBox="0 0 400 400"
    fill="none"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g clip-path="url(#clip0_17_60)">
      <g filter="url(#filter0_f_17_60)">
        <path d="M128.6 0H0V322.2L332.5 211.5L128.6 0Z" fill="#4D07E3"></path>
        <path d="M0 322.2V400H240H320L332.5 211.5L0 322.2Z" fill="#4C00FF"
        ></path>
        <path d="M320 400H400V78.75L332.5 211.5L320 400Z" fill="#B5BFF1"></path>
        <path d="M400 0H128.6L332.5 211.5L400 78.75V0Z" fill="#7fcef3"></path>
      </g>
    </g>
    <defs>
      <filter
        id="filter0_f_17_60"
        x="-159.933"
        y="-159.933"
        width="719.867"
        height="719.867"
        filterUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
        color-interpolation-filters="sRGB">
        <feFlood flood-opacity="0" result="BackgroundImageFix"></feFlood>
        <feBlend
          mode="normal"
          in="SourceGraphic"
          in2="BackgroundImageFix"
          result="shape"></feBlend>
        <feGaussianBlur
          stdDeviation="79.9667"
          result="effect1_foregroundBlur_17_60"></feGaussianBlur>
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>
</section>
<section class="relative">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mt-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
    <div class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-black prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-black prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-black prose-blockquote:text-black/70 max-w-none">      
      <h2
        id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-a-Lexington-product-">
        OVERVIEW
      </h2>

<p>
  Cariloha.com is a premium lifestyle brand known for its eco-friendly, luxury bamboo products including bedding, bath items, and apparel. Focused on sustainability and comfort, Cariloha has cultivated a loyal customer base seeking high-quality, environmentally conscious products.
</p>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
        <!-- <img alt="Solstice Sunglasses" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="1000" height="532" src="/assets/case-study/cariloha-cs1.webp"> -->
      </div>
               <h2 id="account-terms">CHALLENGE</h2>
    <p>
      Cariloha sought to:
    </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <p>
        <b>Acquire new customers</b> by leveraging the power of social media engagement.
      </p>             
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <b>Increase Average Order Value (AOV)</b> through targeted gift card promotions.
      </p>             
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <b>Encourage repeat purchases</b> among existing customers by offering high-value incentives.
      </p>             
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <b>Reward their best customers</b> with fun, engaging content and exclusive offers.
      </p>             
    </li>
   
  </ul> 
    
<div class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <RoundedGrid />
  </div>
      <h2 id="account-terms">SOLUTION </h2>
      <h3>Promotional Campaigns:</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <h4>Inspirational Quote Giveaway:</h4>
          <ul>
          <li>
            <h5>Campaign Details:</h5>
              <ul>
                <li>
                <p>
                   <b> Post:</b> “What inspirational quote comforted you most in 2020? Share it below! We'll select one random comment and gift a $250 online gift card!”
                </p>
                </li>
                 <li>
                  <p>
                    <b>Objective:</b> Drive engagement by encouraging customers to share personal, comforting quotes that resonated with them during a challenging year. The prize: a $250 Cariloha gift card, redeemable for any of their premium bamboo products.
                  </p>
                </li>
              </ul>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4>Valentine’s Day eGift Card Promotion:</h4>
          <p>To capitalize on the Valentine’s Day shopping season, Cariloha ran a second campaign focused on gifting comfort and choice.</p>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center">  
        <img alt="Solstice Sunglasses" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="1000" height="532" src="/assets/case-study/Cariloha-GC.webp">
      </div>
          <ul>
          <li>
            <h5>Campaign Details:</h5>
              <ul>
                <li>
                <p>
                   <b> Post:</b> “The gift of choice! Give your Valentine their choice of bamboo comfort with a Cariloha eGift Card!”
                </p>
                </li>
                 <li>
                  <p>
                    <b>Objective:</b>  Promote the versatility of Cariloha eGift cards as the perfect Valentine’s Day gift, allowing customers to choose from a range of luxurious bamboo products for their loved ones.
                  </p>
                </li>
              </ul>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ol>

      
      
